# PL0MP: React Trading UI App
# Goal:
สร้าง UI หน้าเว็บเทรดแบบมืออาชีพ ด้วย React + TypeScript + MUI + Zustand
ให้ Cursor สร้างโค้ดทั้งหมดตามโครงสร้างด้านล่าง

===========================================================
PROJECT SETUP
===========================================================

Tech Stack:
- React + TypeScript + Vite
- Material UI (MUI)
- Zustand (global store)
- Lightweight-Charts (กราฟแท่งเทียน)
- Axios (เรียก API)
- MUI SX styling

สร้างโฟลเดอร์:
src/
  components/
    layout/
      LeftMenuMini.tsx
      TopChartToolbar.tsx
      CoinListSidebar.tsx
    trading/
      PriceChart.tsx
      CardBotSetting.tsx
      CardOrderList.tsx
      CardReport.tsx
  pages/
      TradingPage.tsx
      ReportPage.tsx
  store/
      tradingStore.ts
  services/
      api.ts
  App.tsx
  main.tsx

ให้ Cursor Gen ไฟล์ทั้งหมด พร้อม mock data

===========================================================
UI DESIGN REQUIREMENTS
===========================================================

Main Layout (TradingPage):

-------------------------------------------------------------
| LeftMiniMenu |      MAIN AREA                             |
| (mini)       |---------------------------------------------|
|              |  TopChartToolbar:                           |
|              |   - Timeframe switch                        |
|              |   - Candle/Line                             |
|              |   - Indicators toggle                       |
|              |---------------------------------------------|
|              |  Row:                                       |
|              |    - PriceChart (70%)                       |
|              |    - CoinListSidebar (30%)                  |
|              |---------------------------------------------|
|              | Bottom Cards Row:                           |
|              |   - CardBotSetting                          |
|              |   - CardOrderList                           |
|              |   - CardReport                              |
--------------------------------------------------------------

STYLE:
- Dark mode theme (พื้นหลัง: #0d1117)
- Card radius: 12px
- Hover effect smooth
- Responsive design

===========================================================
COMPONENT DETAILS
===========================================================

LeftMenuMini:
- Mini vertical menu
- Icons only
- Nav items: Trade, Bot, Orders, Report, Settings
- Hover → Expand menu

TopChartToolbar:
- Dropdown: Timeframe (1m,5m,15m,1h,4h,1D)
- Switch: Candle / Line
- Toggle: Indicators
- Toggle: Volume
- Fullscreen button

PriceChart:
- ใช้ lightweight-charts
- Candlestick chart
- Crosshair
- Zoom/Pan
- Responsive

CoinListSidebar:
- Search box
- List ของเหรียญ BTC / ETH / XRP / BNB / SOL / ADA / DOGE
- Show price + 24h change %

CardBotSetting:
- Strategy: Grid, DCA, Scalping
- Inputs: TP, SL, Grid distance
- Start / Stop button

CardOrderList:
- Table:
  - Order ID
  - Side (Buy/Sell)
  - Price
  - Amount
  - PnL
  - Status

CardReport:
- Tabs = Daily | Monthly | Yearly
- Summary + small bar chart

===========================================================
STATE MANAGEMENT (Zustand)
===========================================================

Store: tradingStore.ts
State:
- selectedCoin: string
- timeframe: string
- chartMode: "candle" | "line"
- toggle indicators
- toggle volume

Actions:
- setSelectedCoin
- setTimeframe
- setChartMode

===========================================================
MOCK API
===========================================================

services/api.ts:
- getCoins()
- getOHLC(coin, timeframe)
- getOpenOrders()
- getDailyReport()

ทั้งหมดให้ Cursor สร้าง mock data

===========================================================
CODE GENERATION RULES
===========================================================

Cursor ต้อง:
✔ สร้างทุก component
✔ ใช้ MUI Grid layout
✔ ใช้ MUI dark theme
✔ ใช้ Zustand เป็น state
✔ ใช้ mock API ชั่วคราว
✔ ทุก card ใช้ <Card sx={{ p:2, borderRadius:2 }}>
✔ ทุกหน้าต้อง responsive

เริ่มสร้างจากหน้า TradingPage.tsx ก่อน

===========================================================
END OF PL0MP
===========================================================

